{
  "about": [
    "Which e2e specs a pull request runs (e2e/ci-select.mjs; docs/areas/ops.md, 'CI e2e'). Paths are globs from the repo's root: * within a folder, ** across folders.",
    "Each changed path, in this order: a 'full' path runs the whole suite; otherwise every area whose paths match adds its specs; otherwise a 'none' path adds nothing; any other path runs the whole suite (fail-safe).",
    "A changed spec always runs itself. The 'smoke' specs run on every pull request. 'leftOut' specs never run on a pull request (the @perf specs). A push to main always runs everything.",
    "A pull request that adds a file under packages/ (or a spec) that no entry here matches fails `check` in its first minute (node e2e/ci-select.mjs unmapped): add it to its area (or a new one), to 'none', or, for shared code, to 'full'."
  ],
  "smoke": [
    "e2e/boss-smoke.spec.ts",
    "e2e/front-door.spec.ts",
    "e2e/boss-character.spec.ts",
    "e2e/lobby-chat.spec.ts"
  ],
  "leftOut": ["e2e/perf.spec.ts"],
  "traced": {
    "about": "Shared modules whose change is followed through the code instead of running everything (e2e/ci-select.mjs, traceChanges): the top-level declarations the diff changes (comments and types don't run), what in the module uses them, then the files that import the module (or its package's entry) and name one of them; each of those counts as a changed path here (its area's specs, a spec itself; a shared foundation or a path no area has runs everything). A user that is itself traced is followed the same way. Every module in packages/core/src but index.ts is traced without being listed here (ci-select.mjs, TRACED_BY_DEFAULT, Nov 10); `modules` lists the others. A new module is followed from everything it exports. A change it can't place (the module removed, code outside any declaration, a file it can't read as code) leaves the module in `full`: every spec. docs/areas/ops.md, 'CI e2e'; docs/decisions/2026-11-01-ci-selection.md.",
    "modules": [
      "packages/server/src/accounts.ts",
      "packages/server/src/api.ts",
      "packages/server/src/account-data.ts",
      "packages/server/src/locker.ts",
      "packages/server/src/boss-tokens.ts",
      "packages/server/src/ranked.ts",
      "e2e/helpers.ts",
      "packages/app/src/net.ts",
      "packages/app/src/solo.ts",
      "packages/app/src/main.tsx",
      "packages/app/src/board/OwnBoard.tsx",
      "packages/app/src/account.ts",
      "packages/app/src/game.ts",
      "packages/app/src/prefs.ts",
      "packages/app/src/test-switches.ts",
      "packages/app/src/screens/Hud.tsx",
      "packages/app/src/components/EvalBar.tsx"
    ],
    "hubs": ["packages/app/src/App.tsx"],
    "hubsAbout": "A traced change that reaches a hub runs everything: App.tsx makes the matches and the account and hands them to every screen, so what it imports reaches every area, not only home's (a change to App.tsx's own code still runs home's specs, as before)."
  },
